  message: "Merged in PR #21 (dev faf57536cc). New Limits.tier_filtered_files (FILE granularity per the item's preference, present-when-populated per INV-virik) records supply-chain tier-dropped file paths at the single filter chokepoint in run_survey, from the pre-filter file nodes. Previously a tier drop (e.g. DERIVED tier-4) removed symbols+edges silently (analysis_incomplete stays False, failed_files empty) — max_tier_applied gave the why, nothing the what. limits.py field+helper+merge+to_dict, schema decorated, e2e tier-4-drop test in TestMaxTierLimitsReporting. Did NOT flip analysis_incomplete or re-architect the filter (one recording line, per the assessment note)."  # c7c9
